Unknown argument: --run
Usage:
  ./openworm_validator --manifest /path/openworm_object_stl_manifest.csv [options]

Options:
  --mm-per-unit 0.1          model-unit to mm scale; Virtual Worm default 0.1
  --max-objects N            load only first N kept objects
  --res N                    CheckOverlaps resolution, default 1000
  --tol-mm X                 CheckOverlaps tolerance in mm, default 0.0001
  --maxerr N                 max overlap errors printed per volume, default 20
  --no-check                 load objects but do not run CheckOverlaps
  --include-categories a,b   only load manifest category_guess values listed
  --exclude-names A,B        skip objects by object_name or safe_name
  --quiet-load               suppress per-object MEMBER_LOADED lines
  --vis                      open interactive Geant4 visualization
  --macro /path/file.mac     execute a visualization/control macro
  --export-gdml /path/out.gdml  write constructed Geant4 geometry to GDML
  --read-gdml /path/in.gdml     read GDML geometry instead of manifest geometry
  --geometry-mode priority|flat|flat_nervous_union  priority=MultiUnion/subtraction, flat=one row one solid
